{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/extras/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1753022143\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/extras/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1753022143\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/extras/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1753022143\" data-has-big /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875280?t=1753022143","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/91ed516099bffe7898cc723244429bbe8c4d0b58/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753022143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/bbeda0cc113b9a030b6a814da2880258fbcab0ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753022143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/bbeda0cc113b9a030b6a814da2880258fbcab0ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753022143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features pretty descriptive mentions of murder and its method, whilst nothing is graphically shown descriptions are detailed"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/extras/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1753022143\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/extras/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1753022143\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875280/extras/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1753022143\" data-has-big /></div></p>","developers":["Rambi_PorkChop"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3540870","name":"You are a Failed Murderer"},"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_